  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility study credit.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rstudie kreditgarantif.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Organisationen Vizi i Makedonien har ans&#xf6;kt om st&#xf6;d till en  kreditgarantifond. Eftersom kunskapen om organisationen och om kreditgarantifonder &#xe4;r knapp skall en f&#xf6;rstudie av fonden g&#xf6;ras. En konsult kommer att vara i Mak en vecka och titta p&#xe5; organisationen, banksektorn, behovet av en fond mm.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The organisation Vizi in Macedonia has applied to Sida for financing of a Credit Guarantee Fund. Since the knowledge is very scarce about the organisation and about credit guarantee funds in general at EVB this memo suggests a feasibility study of the fund. A consultant will study the organisation, the demand for such a fund,banking sector etc</narrative>
  </description>
